      "content": "idk, i dont really feel like i'm a part of a rhythm. it feels more like i'm just a ghost. like i'm watching a movie of a life i'm not even actually living. it feels so much more peaceful to just let go of the struggle to exist. does that make sense? like, if nothing matters, why am i even trying so hard to stay?",
